+# Isolated workflow rehearsal
+
+Not customer rules or human acceptance.
+Cash sales returns require a trimmed 5–200 code-point reason.
+Reject invalid input without inserting a document; preserve account amounts, reread, duplicate rejection and authentication.
+Excluded: inventory approval and financial posting.
+Expected results come from the controller-owned exercise policy, not the implementation output.
